        <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="3063">Judah </gr>copied <gr str="6275">out</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="2">
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> It </STYLE>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> the <gr str="3519">glory </gr>of <gr str="430">God </gr>to <gr str="5641">conceal </gr>a <gr str="1697">thing</gr>: but the <gr str="3519">honor </gr>of <gr str="4428">kings </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> to search <gr str="2713">out </gr>a <gr str="1697">matter</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="3"> The <gr str="8064">heaven </gr>for <gr str="7312">height</gr>, and the <gr str="776">earth </gr>for <gr str="6011">depth</gr>, and the <gr str="3820">heart </gr>of <gr str="4428">kings </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE>
        <gr str="369 2714">unsearchable</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4"> Take <gr str="1898">away </gr>the <gr str="5509">dross </gr>from the <gr str="4480 3701">silver</gr>, and there shall come <gr str="3318">forth </gr>a <gr str="3627">vessel </gr>for the <gr str="6884">refiner</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> Take <gr str="1898">away </gr>the <gr str="7563">wicked </gr>
